# Fixture: a conditional hand-off into ours (tests/playtest.test.js): the
# option whose `when` does not hold is not offered, so the engine goes on to
# the other one, though it would recommend the first.
guide handover/conditional
title Conditional Hand-off
faction Horde
race Undead
levels 11-12
zone Tirisfal Glades
next forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest when level>=40
next forever/horde/02-the-barrens

step Brill
  goto 38.0,50.0 "Brill"
